#!/usr/bin/env bash
#PBS -N beatfm-smoke
#PBS -P wa66
#PBS -q gpuvolta
#PBS -l ncpus=12,ngpus=1,mem=32GB,walltime=00:30:00
#PBS -l storage=scratch/wa66
#PBS -j oe

set -euo pipefail

root=/scratch/wa66/hm6416/beatfm_mirex_20260930
smoke="$root/inference_smoke"
export PYTHONPATH="$smoke/mirex2026:$root/python_deps${PYTHONPATH:+:$PYTHONPATH}"
export BEATFM_SOURCE_DIR="$root/source/BeatFM"
export BEATFM_MERT_DIR="$root/MERT-v1-95M"
export PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1
export OMP_NUM_THREADS=4

cd "$smoke"
/scratch/wa66/hm6416/envs/muse-grpo-cu128/bin/python \
  mirex2026/run_pipeline.py --backbone beatfm --decoder direct \
  --manifest mirex2026/config/backbones.json \
  --checkpoint beatfm_best_val_loss.pt --device cuda:0 \
  smoke_audio.wav direct.txt
/scratch/wa66/hm6416/envs/muse-grpo-cu128/bin/python - <<'PY'
from pathlib import Path
import numpy as np
values = np.loadtxt(Path('direct.txt'), ndmin=1)
if values.ndim != 1 or not len(values) or not np.all(np.isfinite(values)) or np.any(np.diff(values) <= 0):
    raise SystemExit('invalid BeatFM beat-time output')
print(f'BEATFM_GADI_SMOKE_OK beats={len(values)} first={values[0]:.6f}')
PY
